BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Docking with collisions</h1>
Two delta-gliders in orbit, nose to nose, closing at 0.2 m/s with their
docking ports lined up: they must dock (collisions between vessels are not
made at docking ports lined up with each other).
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/DockingTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship DG1
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET DG1
  MODE Extern
  POS 4.0 -20.0 -30
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

